Subject: [PATCH 1/3] models/crack_field: crack-in-elastic-field single-flaw
 fatigue model on the PLA benchmark

ES2020 finite-width crack (one constant a0) and YS2025 void-seeded crack superposed on the
IgBEM field (linear and saturating defect size, a_cap = 2.1 mm a priori). Fits on the paper
split's FIT ids, scores with calibration.pla_fatigue.score (interval + pred_life). Reads only
specimens.csv, splits.json and the stored IgBEM extracts. One command per headline number,
--check against expected.json, 8 tests (~15 s) + 1 slow.

Held stress rms (net stress): ES 0.075 (0.127), YS saturating 0.076 (0.197), YS linear 0.088.

